{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "d5bdc434a46290df2b7b20ff7fbd97a6f255ae408d81fee642916ea897927af4", "ja": "ステラの光", "zh": "群星之光", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "534df1e8fefcf9ff011c00ee45ee84bc8ae4ced20baf5540357b6c64ff06266a", "ja": "生放送が始まり、雪歩と絶妙な連携で司会を\n進行していく貴音。『ステラ』の宣伝もバッ\nチリ決めて、雪歩、春香、伊織と共に、番組\nのステージへ上がり、ファンや視聴者たちへ\n『ステラの光』を届けるのだった。", "zh": "直播开始后，贵音与雪步配合默契，顺利主持着节目。她也完美完成了《ステラ》的宣传，随后与雪步、春香、伊织一同登上节目的舞台，将《ステラの光》传递给粉丝和观众。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1000_null", "source_sha256": "5991189dcfb2991b2b390d4ab83a62554c07c656551886121297ba3cdadbb1bd", "ja": "生放送、開始……", "zh": "直播，开始……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "1583d1641a20bd84c64a4ce6a15cf11c0dab1bdeef5a4b2e5311418430da4ad0", "ja": "歌は、時代を映す鏡……老若男女、温故知新……\n今宵、めくるめく歌の世界に酔いしれましょう……。", "zh": "歌，是映照时代的镜子……无论男女老少，温故而知新……\n今夜，就让我们陶醉在令人目眩神迷的歌之世界吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "82b322fb33d48499923b646220ace9f6b060104a4090f6cf21c108ce34b0b21d", "ja": "こんばんは。司会を務めさせていただきます、\n765プロから参りました、四条貴音と申します。", "zh": "晚上好。我很荣幸担任主持人，来自765事务所的四条贵音。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6dc3d4e123c3b9acac297c2c067ee4c1071428cabcc93ce8a5646e7d1f75a26c", "ja": "同じく、萩原雪歩ですっ。素晴らしい方達が\n揃っていて、とっても緊張してるんですけど……。", "zh": "我也是来自萩原雪步。现场来了这么多\n优秀的前辈，虽然我感到非常紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2f650b264ad038c03f93645a2a36f40554726e17e595a955c8a1b9a965633384", "ja": "それ以上に、いろいろ嬉しくてドキドキしています♪\n今日は私たちと一緒に、楽しんでいきましょう！", "zh": "比起紧张，我更因为各种各样的开心事而心跳不已♪  \n今天也和我们一起尽情享受吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "82e336985c0109ee14095434c51eafc02a6732f3c1643dbd6126ce9433381794", "ja": "それでは『シンギングスター』、今年も開幕です！\nざ・すたーず・うぃる・しんぐ！", "zh": "那么，《Singing Star》今年也要开幕了！\n群星即将歌唱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1006_audience", "source_sha256": "758b23a6dd55c2c1d57990f4e46bf0e12591b5dd8f5619ba8c0bd9a404fa9c65", "ja": "ワアァァァーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1008_sineipopusinnga", "source_sha256": "1a6436e49d8ad01b3e60c90d30023967cd6e793a527d129f213dfb2483963901", "ja": "～♪　……ありがとうございましたーっ！", "zh": "～♪　……谢谢大家——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1009_audience", "source_sha256": "758b23a6dd55c2c1d57990f4e46bf0e12591b5dd8f5619ba8c0bd9a404fa9c65", "ja": "ワアァァァーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "cffbce73ed227ef10c7e09424a96472611918940c54db8c1434f36eca0750bfb", "ja": "というわけで……先日リリースされたばかりの\n新曲を歌っていただきました！　いい曲でしたね……。", "zh": "那么……刚才为大家演唱的是前不久才发行的新歌！真是一首好歌呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1011_008tak", "source_sha256": "0a58641531ceee00f04c157364a51b341ada9452a70630e3ef8e22de394e523a", "ja": "ええ、爽やかでありながら、切なさもあり……\n胸に迫る楽曲でした。真、きゅんです。", "zh": "是的，既清爽又带着一丝伤感……是一首扣人心弦的歌曲。真，让人心动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1012_sineipopusinnga", "source_sha256": "a4c0c8077d9b81409095d44cbe209aff4e77271c58db9419c4fa178281d8736e", "ja": "あはは、ありがとうございます！\nきゅんしてもらえたなら、光栄です♪", "zh": "啊哈哈，谢谢您！\n要是能让您感到心动的话，那真是太荣幸了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "93729ac83c861e673edf606a302a944a43a3be2b1f7d5fe6ded3fc6dafe726d0", "ja": "ありがとうございました！　さてさて、\n続いて参りましょう！　次のスターの方は……？", "zh": "非常感谢！那么那么，\n接着往下进行吧！下一位闪亮之星是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1014_urekkobanndomen", "source_sha256": "ac8efeb1107ce11ec65f7a4bbb116f9d03a679cadd28bda7489d76b6d80a561a", "ja": "センキュー！　イエェェーイッ！", "zh": "谢谢！耶——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1015_audience", "source_sha256": "758b23a6dd55c2c1d57990f4e46bf0e12591b5dd8f5619ba8c0bd9a404fa9c65", "ja": "ワアァァァーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e1b6b727a55472ea6153f6d90dd78b36b085b24e72978bc5a86a6dcfea1e9a36", "ja": "いえええぇぇぇーいっ！", "zh": "耶——！！梵偒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "f09647a87a8fa7f4043bfcf672e6b2d161e8a5ecba65a198ef6dd70251e0ba2c", "ja": "雪歩……？", "zh": "雪步……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2868350085e5685566f69408643c5da8ce66df0b690f0801f9ce52dabcb3d118", "ja": "あっ、ご、ごめんなさい、つい……！\n私、ロックな曲って結構ノッちゃって……。", "zh": "啊，对、对不起，我一不小心就……！\n我听到摇滚歌曲就很容易跟着嗨起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1019_008tak", "source_sha256": "094371cb5735e0c3f91e7d8de10ed8d68870ca16390d44079ab6f859bd8d6b6c", "ja": "そうですか……。では私も。\nいえーい！", "zh": "这样啊……那我也来。\n耶——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1020_audience", "source_sha256": "758b23a6dd55c2c1d57990f4e46bf0e12591b5dd8f5619ba8c0bd9a404fa9c65", "ja": "ワアァァァーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1021_008tak", "source_sha256": "fcf2be794fc027343558c790aa3f7d0b73e71ea0857b3077cd07309392b7e6c3", "ja": "……ありがとうございました。\nさて、次はいよいよ、このすたぁの登場です。", "zh": "……谢谢大家。\n那么，接下来终于要轮到这位明星登场了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1023_audience", "source_sha256": "32ae88a10422430607462715486e647da25dfcb409ca523fd1285df70116ea55", "ja": "ワアァァァーッ！　パチパチパチパチパチ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊——！　啪啪啪啪啪啪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1024_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1b5c5f284032a14221ad46ee51ebff52cd2869faa334d4299c872126cd8731ce", "ja": "……お疲れ様でしたぁ！\n魂に染みこむ、最高の一曲でしたぁ！", "zh": "……辛苦您了～！\n真是一首沁入灵魂、最棒的歌曲～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1025_oomonoennkakasyu", "source_sha256": "b9e8bb5bd2f83ec9937fec2f3f6003b889163a191df66c8f9c8fe19d68f5bc55", "ja": "ははは、ありがとう！　でも、どうだろう？\n今どきの若い子は、演歌なんて聞かないんじゃない？", "zh": "哈哈哈，谢谢！不过，这可不好说吧？\n现在的年轻人，应该不会听演歌之类的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1026_008tak", "source_sha256": "c5082aa7121c79367276c9404c8b7efa112e437eed9833cc52991cc3962474c4", "ja": "機会は少ないのかもしれません。ですが、心を動かせる\n力に変わりはないかと。真、感動いたしました。", "zh": "机会可能确实不多。不过，能够打动人心的力量并不会因此改变。真，我真的很感动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1027_oomonoennkakasyu", "source_sha256": "02c865a7c22ef3344fb4af6cc1373a62fc3fcee74162bb9a59cdbf0e04f503f1", "ja": "おおっ、嬉しいこと言ってくれるねぇっ！\nありがとうっ！", "zh": "哦哦，你这话说得真让人开心！\n谢谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1028_008tak", "source_sha256": "b9a10f3b4aa74dca0aa5172e9946ed61b00bbb2b079b9d2861eca791a9b84775", "ja": "さて、次は……\n私たち『ステラ』の出番となります。", "zh": "那么，接下来就是……\n我们“星光”的登场时间了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1029_004yuk", "source_sha256": "39611651766f3a35ea6e9aabdee17f654be79d1e43155b1b636bbefea92282ae", "ja": "じゃあ、他のメンバーを呼びますね。\n春香ちゃーん！　伊織ちゃーん！", "zh": "那么，我去叫其他成员过来。\n春香——！伊织——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1030_001har", "source_sha256": "e2077c54a70a9a57fd382a8e75d22ac60fc3cde10c8984a366e9433025091345", "ja": "みなさーん！　楽しんでくれていますか？\nまだまだ盛り上がっていきましょうっ！", "zh": "大家——玩得开心吗？\n让我们继续嗨起来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1031_007ior", "source_sha256": "81e1a29b5d41ae7f0a269c5a6d47047ea3627214169732afed1f8ba6d45c28c0", "ja": "会場とお茶の間の伊織ちゃんファンのみんな～！\nお待たせ～♪", "zh": "现场和电视机前喜欢伊织的大家～！\n让你们久等啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1032_audience", "source_sha256": "758b23a6dd55c2c1d57990f4e46bf0e12591b5dd8f5619ba8c0bd9a404fa9c65", "ja": "ワアァァァーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1033_001har", "source_sha256": "4d62bb0ab5176f978481749640c3fa4cb3198b8fcf94b91b537e09d9c0d58aa5", "ja": "えっと、私たち『ステラ』はこの度、765プロライブ\n劇場で、公演を行うことになりました！", "zh": "那个……我们“星光”这次要在765Pro Live剧场举办演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1034_007ior", "source_sha256": "02249303b21165d34ea17fa7c4e19d2833e1a4b66da45362ccfbd42d43b20959", "ja": "天体公演っていうシリーズで、これまでもたくさんの\nユニットが、素敵な輝きを見せてくれたのよね。", "zh": "这是一个叫作“天体公演”的系列，此前也有很多\n组合展现出了迷人的光芒呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1035_004yuk", "source_sha256": "bfbdee249e8e66b51f4a995678d22b85a386ead051cebb9c901063299a1595df", "ja": "13星座、太陽、月……いくつものユニットが\nつないできた公演の最後を、『ステラ』が飾ります。", "zh": "13星座、太阳、月亮……由众多组合\n接力呈现的公演，将由“Stella”献上压轴演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1036_008tak", "source_sha256": "0dcb6487f62f7c55e0e13c78edf4c0fc0cb7734915ee68e44b67e52f896fb7c7", "ja": "皆への感謝と、尊敬……その最後の公演を\n担うことの責任を、今、ひしひしと感じています。", "zh": "对大家的感谢与敬意……以及承担最后一场公演的责任，我现在正深切地感受着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1037_007ior", "source_sha256": "3b6232adfbac46efa84b532672f840e8bc34597f18f2e28396ead88bbf1924eb", "ja": "でも、私たちならきっとできるわ……ううん！\n絶対にやってみせるから、見ていてちょうだい♪", "zh": "但是，只要是我们一定能做到……不对！我们绝对会做到给你看，请好好看着吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0357_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_06_1038_004yuk", "source_sha256": "388330b4e49a33c98adf8dfca0dd41f3a13020df6c6cda5fc2e5ad5db620088e", "ja": "私たちはこれまでも、そしてこれからも、\nみんなで乗り越えて、どこまでも歩いていきます……", "zh": "我们过去如此，未来亦然，\n大家一起跨越重重困难，携手走向远方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
